# Go Version Configuration
# This file centralizes Go version management for the Gno project
# The project supports the current and previous Go versions (N and N-1)

# Minimum supported Go version (N-1)
GO_MIN_VERSION=1.23

# Current Go version (N)
GO_CURRENT_VERSION=1.24

# Docker base image version (use specific version, not "latest")
GO_DOCKER_VERSION=1.24-alpine

# CI/CD version (should match GO_MIN_VERSION)
GO_CI_VERSION=1.23.x

# Notes:
# - When updating versions, run misc/bump-go.sh to update all references
# - All go.mod files should use GO_MIN_VERSION
# - CI should use GO_MIN_VERSION for maximum compatibility
# - Docker uses latest for development convenience
# - Development can use GO_CURRENT_VERSION